Spanish verb paradigms in spa-conj.json are derived from the UniMorph Spanish
dataset (https://github.com/unimorph/spa), extracted from English Wiktionary.

License: Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 3.0 Unported
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/

Adaptations in this file: finite forms, the affirmative and negative
imperative (leading "no " stripped from negative forms), the gerund, and
the masculine singular past participle only; voseo duplicates dropped in
favor of tuteo (tú / vosotros);
paradigms kept only when the infinitive is also a verb headword in the
bundled FreeDict spa-deu dictionary.

Attribute the UniMorph project and the English Wiktionary contributors.
Share adaptations of this file under the same CC BY-SA 3.0 license.
